visible.message:
I call st.rerun() from a button inside an @st.fragment, and pages are chosen with streamlit_option_menu in the sidebar. Clicking Reload shows the main page instead of the fragment's page. Code:

@st.fragment
def SERVER():
    st.write('SERVER')
    if st.button('Reload'):
        st.rerun()

with st.sidebar:
    choice = option_menu('Menu', ['Main_page', 'SERVER'])
if choice == 'SERVER':
    SERVER()

Streamlit 1.37.0, Python 3.10.12.

